    "details": [
      "Rounds 1-3: 32% of 37 picks hit, finishing on average 13.9 position-rank spots below where they were drafted, though every one of them played.",
      "Rounds 4-6 and 7-9 hit 36% and 34% of the time and missed by the most, 24.0 and 26.8 spots on average; 13% of round 7-9 picks never scored a point.",
      "Rounds 10+: 61% of 147 picks hit, finishing 0.7 spots above price on average.",
